# Voice: the voice container, the TTS and the recognizer service (docs/voice.md). COMPOSE_PROFILES must contain voice to run
# it; the satellites stream their audio to BIND_ADDRESS:8091 and fetch the spoken files through the dashboard
# (BIND_ADDRESS:DASHBOARD_PORT). Its settings are in Settings -> Voice, not here.
# The key the plug-in calls the voice container with (generated by make install).
VOICE_TTS_KEY=
